id=gxr-handtracking-toggle
name=Galaxy XR hand tracking toggle
version=v1.0.0
versionCode=3
author=compdoge
description=Action button toggles whether the Galaxy XR can switch its active input mode to hand tracking, by live-patching two instructions in surfaceflinger's own process memory (never a file on disk). Confirmed live: releasing a controller's grip no longer switches to HAND and no longer suspends the controllers while disabled. Not remembered across reboot: press Action again after a reboot.
